OL,3,AIsrael-bound flight lands in Saudi
OL,4,AArabia after reported stabbing in
OL,5,Acockpit
OL,6,
OL,7,FA flight from Dubai to Israel has
OL,8,Flanded in Saudi Arabia after a fight
OL,9,Freportedly broke out between the
OL,10,Fco-pilots
OL,12,FAn Israeli passenger on board tells
OL,13,Fjournalists the crew asked for help,
OL,14,Fand that passengers helped tackle one
OL,15,Fof the pilots and tie him down
OL,17,FThe Flydubai plane - which set off
OL,18,Fearly on Wednesday - signalled an
OL,19,Femergency code two hours into the
OL,20,Fflight, tracking website Flightradar24
OL,21,Fsays
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
